# The code built into Brush

`brush_app` of Brush is built by the CI of Immuch360 from the sources of Brush (Apache-2.0, `brush-LICENSE.txt`), with
the crates below compiled into it. This file is written by cargo about at each build: every crate with its version and
the licence it declares, then the text of each licence as found in the crates (or the SPDX text when a crate carries
no file). The crates come from crates.io, or from the git repositories that `Cargo.lock` of Brush pins, at the commits
it names.

